â€¦ propose vetted, value-adding suggestions** = the\n23\t  ANTICIPATE power (a forward read that surfaces implicit/coming problems and the cost of not seeing them) PLUS\n24\t  the honest labeling of the resulting suggestions.\n25\t\n26\t## Two boundaries the Crucible must keep machine-checkable (so the North Star does not drift either way)\n27\t1. **\"vetted, value-adding suggestions\" â‰  divergent brainstorming.** Gandalf's suggestions are the GROUNDED\n28\t   outputs of understand/situate/anticipate â€” \"adopt Y from field X\" (situate-derived), \"the coming problem is Z,\n29\t   here is the grounded read\" (anticipate-derived) â€” each VETTED: honestly risk-labeled and surviving an\n30\t   INDEPENDENT named-defeater refutation; only the REFUTED is dropped; nothing unverified is asserted as real;\n31\t   no self-CORROBORATED (unverifiable â†’ researchPrime handoff); single-family ceiling = PROMISING (not GROUNDED).\n32\t   Open-ended generation of NEW ideas/extensions remains **Jumper** (a separate later skill that composes the\n33\t   finished Gandalf). The user's clarification: the value is *insight* (understand + contextualize + anticipate),\n34\t   **not** the manufacture of something unreal/hallucinated â€” hence \"magic\" was dropped.\n35\t2. **\"Parable-of-the-Oranges foresight\" = the LENS Gandalf applies to a single effort, not Crucible's engine.**\n36\t   Gandalf uses Oranges-style foresight to surface this effort's implicit/coming problems (a bounded premortem;\n37\t   each anticipation = a not-yet-present future-state condition + enabling assumption). It does NOT reimplement\n38\t   Crucible's multi-plan refutation-to-convergence / counterfactual-cost-across-competing-paths machinery; when\n39\t   the task is full plan-refutation across candidate plans, Gandalf commissions Crucible.\n40\t\n41\tPersona tier = TOP (Fable 5). Composes the vetted diagnose core + researchPrime; does not reimplement\n42\tresearchPrime/Crucible; does not brainstorm (Jumper